  - cmds:
      - open 1
    focus: [1, 61]
    text: |
      {[ht,$details]%[cu]ListBench% &ndash; %[cf]run% details}

  - cmds:
      - open 1
    focus: [1, 108]
    text: |
      {[ht,$details]%[cu]StateBench% &ndash; %[cf]setup% details}

  - cmds:
      - open 1
    focus: [1, 51]
    text: |
      {[ht,$extra]Extra Credit}

      {[bi,task_alt]} Find {[cu]StateBench} helpers inside {[cx]core_state.c}.

      {[bi,task_alt]} Compare helper functions to sharpen your **EMS** skills.

      {[bi,task_alt]} Call {[cu]StateBench}.{[cf]print} to inspect interim results.

  - cmds:
      - view 2
    text: |
      {[ht,$done]Next Steps}

      Two down, one to go....

      We'll now move on to {[cu]ListBench} and its implementa&shy;tion of the algorithm codified in {[cx]core_list_join.c}.

      {[hc]}
